flowchart TB
  A[Production traces<br>and grades] --> B[Mine failures<br>Chapter 28 taxonomy]
  B --> C[New eval cases<br>deduplicated, labeled]
  C --> D[Baseline: current release<br>on the grown suite]
  D --> E[Change: prompt, skill,<br>tool or model]
  E --> F{Offline evaluation}
  F -->|pass| G{Shadow}
  G -->|pass| H{Canary: production<br>evaluation}
  H -->|pass| I[Promote]
  F -->|fail| X[Reject]
  G -->|fail| X
  H -->|fail| R[Roll back]
  I --> A
  R --> A
  X -.->|try another change| E